WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
1. Open your station in Safari

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.200
2. Tap the tab menu, then Share

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.400
3. Choose Add to Home Screen

4
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.600
4. Keep the station name and tap Add

5
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.600
5. The station icon lands on your home screen

6
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.600
6. It opens straight to live arrivals
